:<fpage>102</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16263780</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b6"><label>6</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>O&#x02019;Connor</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Wakefield</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Karim</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Emery</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>Practice, training, and ultrasonography for rheumatologists: the development of specific competency based educational outcomes.</article-title> <source>Ann Rheum Dis</source> <year>2006</year>;<volume>65</volume>:<fpage>629</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>36</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16192291</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b7"><label>7</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Filippucci</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Meenagh</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ciapetti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Iagnocco</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Taggart</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Grassi</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>E-learning in ultrasonography: a web based approach.</article-title> <source>Ann Rheum Dis</source> <year>2007</year>;<volume>66</volume>:<fpage>962</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>5</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17329310</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b8"><label>8</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Woolf</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>Sp